<title>USA: U.S. barge rates lightly quoted on call session.</title>
<headline>U.S. barge rates lightly quoted on call session.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barge rates were lightly quoted at the St. Louis Merchants Exchange. No barges traded versus none Wednesday.</p>
<p>The only offer was:</p>
<p>- One barge, Mississippi (Cairo), maximum $500 switch, no bid, offered 15 points lower at 100 percent of tariff.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-3720))</p>
</text>
